3.2 Conditions with if, elif, else

age = 17

if age &gt;= 18:
    print("You are an adult.")
else:
    print("You are a minor.")

You are a minor.


Handling multiple cases:

grade = 2.3

if grade &lt;= 1.5:
    print("Very good")
elif grade &lt;= 2.5:
    print("Good")
elif grade &lt;= 3.5:
    print("Satisfactory")
else:
    print("Sufficient or worse")

Good
